10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vlxwdik3GKYQ7kNvwEtUPVD&_nc_oc=Adp4n9XL6S-2i-kmhSukJQlfX0eUHApQC39WCvzz-cyzt7pYkEwjuX1v-Zw1mqwkqOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQADhtNwfEZXWxsRHiwr3lD4eKkRBUKM1NQop-TcK2C9DQ&oe=6A6A0D4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QOSeSU3NdLEQ7kNvwHMhDDn&_nc_oc=Ado8buckx_LW_koX0CVMYdHhjSA2WGKPpl0u7qRiczdtYs9eNjDAtavhrhp97X5oGf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCxINu8rBAKbc4-kyYy3Y3r-WZ5gGcPy-dMjTqfxVzumw&oe=6A69E5FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t3vAFIgtDAcQ7kNvwEB80th&_nc_oc=AdrlD-gstCGE4tP0PshqwUGq5ohn0Ik3KCTznFy9xzDoV4fZWNpbXly5GmTq55oUw48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB4dVeyQYMHXzox4i7BJ4wroBKWz4S9DjlUqrfJZKK7DA&oe=6A69FD2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore